*  mrbp_result_capture.sno - THE GENERALIZATION (s71).  The defect is NOT the
*  embedded-value form: lower_snobol4.c rewrites "X = subj ? pat" into
*  "subj ? (pat . X)", so the value form is an ORDINARY whole-pattern "." capture.
*  This witness writes that capture EXPLICITLY and fails identically, which is the
*  falsifiable prediction that confirmed the root cause.
*  ⇒ ANY conditional (".") capture whose fc_walk_range crosses an IR_MATCH_DEFER is
*  denied its cell and binds the NULL STRING, while the inner "$" immediate capture
*  in the same pattern still binds correctly.
*  Oracle prints MATCH / X=[ABC] / W=[ABC].  SCRIP prints X=[] on both arms.
        Q = LEN(3) $ W
        S = 'ABCDEF'
        S ? Q . X                                :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'MATCH'                         :(D)
N       OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
D       OUTPUT = 'X=[' X ']'
        OUTPUT = 'W=[' W ']'
END
